    "final_answer": "Based on my extensive research on apple.com, I need to report an important finding:\n\n## Result: The iPhone 14 Plus is No Longer Available on Apple.com\n\nThe Apple iPhone 14 Plus has been **discontinued** and is no longer sold directly on apple.com. Here's what I found:\n\n1. **Product page (apple.com/iphone-14-plus/)**: Returns \"The page you're looking for can't be found\" (404 error)\n2. **Buy page (apple.com/shop/buy-iphone/iphone-14-plus)**: Also returns 404 error\n3. **iPhone Compare page**: Shows iPhone 14 Plus with status \"Available at authorized resellers\" (no price listed, no \"Buy\" button)\n4. **Refurbished Store**: Does not include iPhone 14 Plus in its inventory\n5. **Current iPhone lineup**: Only includes iPhone Duo, iPhone 18 Pro/Pro Max, iPhone Air, iPhone 17, iPhone 17e, and iPhone 16\n\nThe only confirmation I could find regarding color availability on the Compare page is that the iPhone 14 Plus was offered in **Blue, Purple, Yellow, Midnight, and Starlight** — so Purple was indeed a valid color option.\n\n### Conclusion\nI cannot complete the price check task as requested because Apple no longer sells the iPhone 14 Plus directly on its website. The product has been fully discontinued. Apple directs interested customers to **authorized resellers** for remaining stock, but pricing is no longer displayed on apple.com itself.\n\nIf you need pricing information, I would suggest checking authorized Apple resellers (such as Best Buy, Amazon, or carrier stores) for current availability and pricing of the iPhone 14 Plus 256GB in Purple.",
